### 1. Register Owner
POST http://localhost:8080/owners/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rufina2@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "name": "Rufina"
}

###

### 2. Sign In (to verify works)
POST http://localhost:8080/owners/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rufina2@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### 3. Create Restaurant for that owner
POST http://localhost:8080/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "75cdc3c4-a95d-4698-8a94-884a7e2aac07",
  "restaurantName": "Rufina Fine Dining",
  "streetName": "Grand Avenue",
  "streetNumber": "42A",
  "postalCode": "1000",
  "city": "Brussels",
  "country": "Belgium",
  "contactEmail": "contact@rufinarestaurant.be",
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/rufina.jpg",
  "typeOfCuisine": "French",
  "defaultPreparationTime": 25,
  "openingHours": {
    "monday": "10:00-22:00",
    "tuesday": "10:00-22:00"
  }
}


###